# ToolkitPlugins - Test Cases

## TDD Mandate
These tests MUST be written in XCTest BEFORE implementing the feature.

1. **Test `PluginManager.sort()` returns plugins A -> B -> C when C depends on B and B depends on A**.
2. **Test `PluginManager.sort()` throws a CyclicDependencyError when A depends on B and B depends on A**.
3. **Test all registered plugins receive `onBackground` execution when the app broadcasts standard lifecycle notification**.
